  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8dd7a141c748993488987ea9338aa3be, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: "\xCEnt\xE2lnirea"
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare prezint\u0103 dou\u0103 figuri umane surprinse
    \xEEntr-un moment de apropiere, suger\xE2nd o interac\u021Biune simbolic\u0103
    \xEEntre for\u021Be opuse sau complementare. Compozi\u021Bia aerisit\u0103 \u0219i
    gesturile expresive accentueaz\u0103 ideea de mi\u0219care \u0219i echilibru,
    iar elementele clasice sunt reinterpretate \xEEntr-o estetic\u0103 modern\u0103.
    Lucrarea invit\u0103 la reflec\u021Bie asupra rela\u021Biei dintre corp, spa\u021Biu
    \u0219i sensul \xEEnt\xE2lnirii dintre dou\u0103 prezen\u021Be distincte."
  renderersToHighlight: []
