  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8dd7a141c748993488987ea9338aa3be, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: "Revela\u021Bie mitologic\u0103"
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare prezint\u0103 o scen\u0103 cu personaje mitologice
    surprinse \xEEntr-un moment dramatic, \xEEnc\u0103rcat de simbolism \u0219i mi\u0219care.
    Compozi\u021Bia dinamic\u0103, gesturile ample \u0219i contrastul dintre lumin\u0103
    \u0219i umbr\u0103 accentueaz\u0103 caracterul narativ al scenei. Influen\u021Bele
    artei clasice sunt vizibile \xEEn tratarea corpului uman \u0219i \xEEn expresivitatea
    figurilor, iar atmosfera general\u0103 sugereaz\u0103 interven\u021Bia divin\u0103
    \u0219i leg\u0103tura dintre lumea uman\u0103 \u0219i cea supranatural\u0103."
  renderersToHighlight: []
