  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8dd7a141c748993488987ea9338aa3be, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: Consiliul umbrelor
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare prezint\u0103 o scen\u0103 de interior cu mai
    multe personaje angajate \xEEntr-un dialog t\u0103cut, suger\xE2nd un moment
    de reflec\u021Bie, judecat\u0103 sau deliberare. Iluminarea redus\u0103 \u0219i
    paleta cromatic\u0103 temperat\u0103 accentueaz\u0103 atmosfera intim\u0103 \u0219i
    misterioas\u0103 a compozi\u021Biei. Rela\u021Bia dintre personaje, pozi\u021Bionarea
    lor \xEEn spa\u021Biu \u0219i gesturile discrete construiesc o nara\u021Biune
    deschis\u0103, invit\xE2nd privitorul s\u0103 interpreteze semnifica\u021Bia
    \xEEnt\xE2lnirii \u0219i tensiunile subtile dintre protagoni\u0219ti."
  renderersToHighlight: []
