  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8dd7a141c748993488987ea9338aa3be, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: "Masca eternit\u0103\u021Bii"
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare reprezint\u0103 o masc\u0103 funerar\u0103 stilizat\u0103,
    asociat\u0103 ideii de via\u021B\u0103 etern\u0103 \u0219i protec\u021Bie spiritual\u0103.
    Chipul idealizat, simetria strict\u0103 \u0219i cromatica aurie evoc\u0103 concep\u021Biile
    egiptene despre divinitate, putere \u0219i nemurire. Elementele decorative \u0219i
    liniile clare accentueaz\u0103 caracterul sacru al imaginii, suger\xE2nd rolul
    m\u0103\u0219tii ca leg\u0103tur\u0103 \xEEntre lumea p\u0103m\xE2ntean\u0103
    \u0219i cea de dincolo."
  renderersToHighlight: []
