  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8dd7a141c748993488987ea9338aa3be, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: "Audien\u021B\u0103 regal\u0103"
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare prezint\u0103 o scen\u0103 ceremonial\u0103
    cu dou\u0103 personaje regale redate \xEEntr-o compozi\u021Bie frontal\u0103
    \u0219i rigid\u0103, specific\u0103 artei inspirate din Egiptul antic. Postura,
    vestimenta\u021Bia elaborat\u0103 \u0219i decorul bogat simbolizeaz\u0103 autoritatea,
    sacralitatea \u0219i ordinea social\u0103. Cromatica intens\u0103 \u0219i detaliile
    ornamentale accentueaz\u0103 caracterul solemn al scenei, suger\xE2nd o \xEEnt\xE2lnire
    cu semnifica\u021Bie politic\u0103 sau religioas\u0103 \xEEn cadrul unei civiliza\u021Bii
    idealizate."
  renderersToHighlight: []
