  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: Dans ritualic
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare ilustreaz\u0103 o scen\u0103 de dans ritualic,
    \xEEn care figurile sunt surprinse \xEEn mi\u0219care, suger\xE2nd un act ceremonial
    sau festiv. Personajele sunt redate \xEEntr-un stil simplificat, cu gesturi expresive
    \u0219i ritm vizual accentuat de repeti\u021Bia formelor. Cromatica \u0219i textura
    lucr\u0103rii evoc\u0103 pictura antic\u0103, iar compozi\u021Bia subliniaz\u0103
    leg\u0103tura dintre mi\u0219care, comunitate \u0219i simbolism cultural."
  renderersToHighlight: []
