  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8dd7a141c748993488987ea9338aa3be, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: "Apropiere divin\u0103"
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare reprezint\u0103 o scen\u0103 intim\u0103 cu
    personaje mitologice, surprinse \xEEntr-un moment de apropiere \u0219i tandre\u021Be.
    Compozi\u021Bia este dominat\u0103 de gesturi delicate \u0219i de o rela\u021Bie
    subtil\u0103 \xEEntre priviri \u0219i posturi, suger\xE2nd leg\u0103tura dintre
    uman \u0219i divin. Tratarea idealizat\u0103 a anatomiei \u0219i paleta cromatic\u0103
    echilibrat\u0103 reflect\u0103 influen\u021Bele artei clasice, conferind scenei
    o atmosfer\u0103 armonioas\u0103 \u0219i contemplativ\u0103."
  renderersToHighlight: []
