  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: Allegoria puterii
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare prezint\u0103 o scen\u0103 alegoric\u0103 \xEEn
    care figura feminin\u0103 central\u0103 este \xEEnso\u021Bit\u0103 de personaje
    simbolice, suger\xE2nd ideea de autoritate, echilibru \u0219i control. Postura
    sigur\u0103, obiectele asociate \u0219i raportul dintre personaje construiesc
    o compozi\u021Bie \xEEnc\u0103rcat\u0103 de semnifica\u021Bii morale \u0219i
    politice. Tratarea atent\u0103 a anatomiei \u0219i a drapajelor, al\u0103turi
    de fundalul arhitectural, eviden\u021Biaz\u0103 influen\u021Bele artei clasice
    \u0219i caracterul narativ al scenei."
  renderersToHighlight: []
