  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: Ritual al zeilor
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare \xEEnf\u0103\u021Bi\u0219eaz\u0103 o scen\u0103
    ritualic\u0103 \xEEn care personaje cu tr\u0103s\u0103turi divine \u0219i simbolice
    particip\u0103 la un act ceremonial. Compozi\u021Bia este construit\u0103 dup\u0103
    reguli stricte de ierarhie \u0219i propor\u021Bie, specifice artei inspirate
    din Egiptul antic. Cromatica intens\u0103 \u0219i detaliile iconografice eviden\u021Biaz\u0103
    caracterul sacru al scenei, suger\xE2nd rela\u021Bia dintre oameni, zei \u0219i
    ordinea cosmic\u0103."
  renderersToHighlight: []
