  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: "\xCEnv\u0103\u021B\u0103tur\u0103 \u0219i credin\u021B\u0103"
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare surprinde un moment de transmitere a cunoa\u0219terii
    \u0219i a credin\u021Bei, redat prin interac\u021Biunea atent\u0103 dintre personaje.
    Gesturile discrete \u0219i privirile concentrate sugereaz\u0103 un act de \xEEnv\u0103\u021B\u0103tur\u0103
    sau revela\u021Bie spiritual\u0103. Fundalul arhitectural amplu \u0219i atmosfera
    solemn\u0103 contribuie la profunzimea scenei, eviden\u021Biind influen\u021Bele
    picturii clasice \u0219i caracterul contemplativ al compozi\u021Biei."
  renderersToHighlight: []
