  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8dd7a141c748993488987ea9338aa3be, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: "Viziune apocaliptic\u0103"
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare prezint\u0103 o scen\u0103 complex\u0103, cu
    numeroase personaje \u0219i elemente arhitecturale, suger\xE2nd un moment de
    criz\u0103 sau revela\u021Bie colectiv\u0103. Compozi\u021Bia ampl\u0103 \u0219i
    dinamica figurilor transmit un sentiment de agita\u021Bie \u0219i tensiune, \xEEn
    timp ce elementele simbolice din planul superior sugereaz\u0103 o interven\u021Bie
    supranatural\u0103. Influen\u021Bele clasice sunt evidente \xEEn construc\u021Bia
    scenei \u0219i \xEEn tratarea perspectivei, oferind lucr\u0103rii un caracter
    narativ puternic."
  renderersToHighlight: []
