  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: Dialog sacru
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare prezint\u0103 o scen\u0103 simbolic\u0103 de
    dialog sau ofrand\u0103 \xEEntre dou\u0103 personaje, redate conform conven\u021Biilor
    iconografice inspirate din arta egiptean\u0103. Posturile rigide, gesturile ceremoniale
    \u0219i elementele decorative subliniaz\u0103 caracterul ritualic al scenei.
    Compozi\u021Bia echilibrat\u0103 \u0219i cromatica cald\u0103 sugereaz\u0103
    ideea de armonie, comunicare sacr\u0103 \u0219i ordine spiritual\u0103."
  renderersToHighlight: []
