  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: Portret interior
  description: "Aceast\u0103 sculptur\u0103 de tip bust surprinde o figur\u0103 feminin\u0103
    \xEEntr-un moment de introspec\u021Bie, sugerat de \xEEnclinarea capului \u0219i
    de expresia calm\u0103 a tr\u0103s\u0103turilor. Lipsa bra\u021Belor \u0219i
    tratarea fragmentar\u0103 a corpului concentreaz\u0103 aten\u021Bia asupra fe\u021Bei
    \u0219i a volumelor principale, accentu\xE2nd caracterul expresiv al lucr\u0103rii.
    Suprafe\u021Bele netede, u\u0219or patinate, contribuie la senza\u021Bia de delicate\u021Be
    \u0219i intimitate, invit\xE2nd privitorul la contemplare."
  renderersToHighlight: []
