  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: Gest ritualic
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare fragmentar\u0103 surprinde o figur\u0103 uman\u0103
    redat\u0103 \xEEntr-o postur\u0103 expresiv\u0103, suger\xE2nd un gest ritualic
    sau ceremonial. Starea de conservare \u0219i marginile neregulate contribuie
    la impresia de vechime \u0219i autenticitate, iar cromatica estompat\u0103 accentueaz\u0103
    caracterul istoric al imaginii. Compozi\u021Bia simpl\u0103 \u0219i gestica ampl\u0103
    transmit ideea de mi\u0219care \u0219i semnifica\u021Bie simbolic\u0103, evoc\xE2nd
    practicile \u0219i credin\u021Bele culturilor antice."
  renderersToHighlight: []
