  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: "C\u0103derea"
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare surprinde o scen\u0103 intens dramatic\u0103,
    dominat\u0103 de mi\u0219care, tensiune \u0219i contrast puternic \xEEntre lumin\u0103
    \u0219i umbr\u0103. Corpul uman este redat \xEEntr-o pozi\u021Bie instabil\u0103,
    suger\xE2nd o pr\u0103bu\u0219ire fizic\u0103 \u0219i simbolic\u0103. Tratarea
    expresiv\u0103 a anatomiei \u0219i fundalul \xEEntunecat accentueaz\u0103 sentimentul
    de vulnerabilitate \u0219i conflict interior, evoc\xE2nd teme precum pedeapsa,
    suferin\u021Ba sau pierderea controlului."
  renderersToHighlight: []
