  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: "For\u021Ba destinului"
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare prezint\u0103 dou\u0103 personaje surprinse
    \xEEntr-o compozi\u021Bie tensionat\u0103, dominat\u0103 de mi\u0219care \u0219i
    emo\u021Bie. Gesturile ample \u0219i expresiile dramatice sugereaz\u0103 un conflict
    sau o confruntare cu o for\u021B\u0103 superioar\u0103, simboliz\xE2nd lupta
    dintre voin\u021Ba uman\u0103 \u0219i destin. Contrastul dintre lumin\u0103 \u0219i
    umbre, precum \u0219i tratarea dinamic\u0103 a corpului, trimit la tradi\u021Bia
    picturii clasice, pun\xE2nd accent pe intensitatea narativ\u0103 a scenei."
  renderersToHighlight: []
