  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: Zeitate protectoare
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare reprezint\u0103 o figur\u0103 divin\u0103 central\u0103,
    \xEEnconjurat\u0103 de simboluri \u0219i personaje secundare, \xEEntr-o compozi\u021Bie
    dens\u0103 \u0219i ierarhic\u0103. Personajul principal este redat frontal \u0219i
    domin\u0103 scena, subliniind rolul de protec\u021Bie \u0219i autoritate spiritual\u0103.
    Bog\u0103\u021Bia detaliilor, cromatica intens\u0103 \u0219i organizarea strict\u0103
    a elementelor vizuale reflect\u0103 influen\u021Ba artei egiptene, unde imaginea
    avea rol ritualic \u0219i narrativ."
  renderersToHighlight: []
