  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8dd7a141c748993488987ea9338aa3be, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExhibitInfo
  title: Extaz celest
  description: "Aceast\u0103 lucrare prezint\u0103 o scen\u0103 de eleva\u021Bie
    spiritual\u0103, \xEEn care figurile umane \u0219i angelice sunt surprinse \xEEntr-o
    compozi\u021Bie fluid\u0103 \u0219i dinamic\u0103. Mi\u0219carea ascendent\u0103,
    jocul luminii \u0219i tratarea vaporos\u0103 a formelor sugereaz\u0103 ideea
    de transcendere \u0219i comuniune cu planul divin. Influen\u021Bele artei clasice
    sunt evidente \xEEn modelarea corpului \u0219i \xEEn expresivitatea gesturilor,
    conferind scenei o atmosfer\u0103 intens emo\u021Bional\u0103 \u0219i contemplativ\u0103."
  renderersToHighlight: []
